        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview</strong><br>In <i>Ping Pan</i>, your goal is simple: get the ping pong ball into the cup. You’ll place down pots, pans, and all sorts of everyday objects to create ramps, bouncers, and deflectors that guide the ball along a path of your own design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level starts the same way: a ball launcher fires a ping pong ball into the scene. From there, it’s up to you to build a chain reaction of ricochets and bounces that will carry it into the goal. <br><br>Experiment, adjust, and watch as your setup comes to life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is easy to pick up, but endlessly repayable thanks to the freedom of creativity. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973980/extras/9ee62884a912379a8ca34a46d7a4df60.poster.avif?t=1764342123\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973980/extras/9ee62884a912379a8ca34a46d7a4df60.webm?t=1764342123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973980/extras/9ee62884a912379a8ca34a46d7a4df60.mp4?t=1764342123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Gameplay:</strong> Solve each puzzle your way using a toolbox of household items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfying Physics:</strong> Watch balls bounce, ricochet, and roll with (somewhat) realistic physics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability:</strong> Multiple solutions per level encourage creativity and experimentation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible Fun:</strong> Easy to learn, quick to play, and hard to put down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive:</strong> Come up with ways to beat your friends solutions with the fasted solution, longest path, least/most bounces.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview</strong><br>In <i>Ping Pan</i>, your goal is simple: get the ping pong ball into the cup. You’ll place down pots, pans, and all sorts of everyday objects to create ramps, bouncers, and deflectors that guide the ball along a path of your own design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level starts the same way: a ball launcher fires a ping pong ball into the scene. From there, it’s up to you to build a chain reaction of ricochets and bounces that will carry it into the goal. <br><br>Experiment, adjust, and watch as your setup comes to life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is easy to pick up, but endlessly repayable thanks to the freedom of creativity. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973980/extras/9ee62884a912379a8ca34a46d7a4df60.poster.avif?t=1764342123\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973980/extras/9ee62884a912379a8ca34a46d7a4df60.webm?t=1764342123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973980/extras/9ee62884a912379a8ca34a46d7a4df60.mp4?t=1764342123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Gameplay:</strong> Solve each puzzle your way using a toolbox of household items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfying Physics:</strong> Watch balls bounce, ricochet, and roll with (somewhat) realistic physics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability:</strong> Multiple solutions per level encourage creativity and experimentation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible Fun:</strong> Easy to learn, quick to play, and hard to put down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive:</strong> Come up with ways to beat your friends solutions with the fasted solution, longest path, least/most bounces.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Place objects. Bounce balls. Land it in the cup. Ping Pan is a simple, addictive puzzle game with handcrafted levels, multiple solutions, and a level editor for endless creativity.",
